PS5 display on 7.3.1: our FLAVA3/Verde stack (as in v2.1.x), in place of rmux's display rework

Our display code replayed onto plain 7.3.1: the HDMI chip driver (FLAVA3 and Verde setup, 4K120 over FRL by
Lawson, standard 1080p/1440p/2160p modes with the FLAVA3 1440p timings, VRR, re-arm, EDID keep and fallback, SCDC,
sleep mute, RGB range, Verde game content), CEC, USB-C DisplayPort, and amdgpu's PS5 display hooks and DC link
changes. rmux's FRL planner, recovery and ALLM go out with it; everything outside the display stays his.
